WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:05.560
Wh...

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.360
What the hell is that?

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.450
Orchis!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:25.920
Io! Lyria!

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.090
Lyria!

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:46.560
Lyria...

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.860
Wake up, Lyria! Lyria!

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:56.530
Are you okay? Are you hurt anywhere?

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.410
Io...

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.080
Where...

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.120
Where are we?

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.840
I think it's the primal beast's tummy...

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.710
We're inside...

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.260
...the primal beast's tummy?

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.020
Whaaaaat?!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.410
This is one hell of a mess
we've gotten ourselves into.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.500
It's all my fault.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.660
Celeste was after me.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.540
Because of me, the girls...

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.300
They'll be all right.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:24.350
Lyria and I share the same life.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.060
Same life?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:30.180
It may seem hard to believe, but it's true.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.310
It's complicated, see.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:37.320
The fact that I'm okay right now
is the best possible proof that Lyria's safe.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.320
And that should mean Io and Orchis are safe, too.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.030
If you say so, then that's a load off my mind.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.790
Thank goodness everyone's safe. Right, Ferry?

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.540
But who knows how long they will last...

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.960
Celeste feeds on the villagers on a regular basis.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.380
We can assume she digests whatever she swallows.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.590
Now that sounds pretty bad.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.680
Let's hurry and figure out a way to rescue them.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.800
Eugen...

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.810
Yeah, I'll get the ship ready for lift off.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.770
Thanks.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.770
My, what would we do without you?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:17.900
Jeez, look at you,
treating everyone in sight like an ally.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.440
You sure about these two?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.900
Yes. I think.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.410
All right, good luck to you on that.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.160
Oh, hold up.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.080
About the airship...

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:34.750
Lyria...

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:43.550
So this is what the belly
of a primal beast looks like...

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.840
I couldn't have imagined it.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:49.390
How do you even explain it?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.350
I have no idea...

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.020
How about you?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.350
Well...

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:01.110
In any case, we've gotta get out of here
as soon as possible.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.150
Yes, but...

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.360
Which way should we go?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.110
Yeah, that's the question.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.070
What should we do?

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.000
This kind of reminds me of...

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.540
Huh? What was I doing just now?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.710
Io?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.130
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:25.970
Oh...

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.760
A-A door?

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.640
Freaky... It's just way too freaky...

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.730
What do you think it's about?

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:40.310
Should we just open it?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.150
What?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.860
Can't get any weirder than
being in a primal's belly,

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:50.830
and since this field of flowers seems endless,
we can't tell which direction we should go.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.910
You're right.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.910
I'm gonna open it. Ready?

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.580
Who knows, it might just be the way out.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.630
Wh-What's going on here?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.480
We'll find that exit, whatever it takes.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.900
A-Are you all right, Orchis?

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.320
Are you okay, Lyria?

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.280
Yes, I'm fine.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.950
Thanks.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.120
Again...

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.500
There!

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:49.880
Again...

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:01.350
Just watch, we're busting out of
this horrible place, no matter what!

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.190
Right!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.620
There's two of them.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.200
Which one should we choose?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.370
Let's decide on my count.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.210
All right.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.920
Three, two...

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:27.670
One!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.340
We picked the same one!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:37.850
If the two who can sense primal beasts
chose the same door...

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.390
Then this is it!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.110
Give me a break!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.160
Where're Gran and the others?

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.870
Weren't they with you?

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.710
Yeah, about that...
How do I put this...

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.250
What's wrong?
Did something happen to them?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.260
Well, the thing is...

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.100
Lyria and Io got gobbled up by the primal beast.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.100
You better be joking, Eugen!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:24.400
Calm down, Katalina.
I'll explain later, okay?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.020
I'll get it up and running again in no time!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.320
Forget about the instruments.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.940
I've been told that they're totally useless.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.900
Trust your instinct and experience.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.570
Man, what a messed up island.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.160
<i>Just stay safe until we get there.</i>

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.870
<i>Lyria, Io...</i>

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.750
I think we're getting closer to the exit.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.880
Really?

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.380
It's just a feeling...

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.210
What about you?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.680
I can feel it, too.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.060
Orchis!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.610
You must be thirsty. Here, this is her share.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.700
Go on, give it to her.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.280
Right!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.620
Orchis!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.460
You'll catch a cold.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:12.590
Why...

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.380
Why are you doing all this for me?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:22.050
What? Because... let's see...

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.470
Because I want to be friends with you.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.280
Aww, this is going well.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.370
Io!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.580
Are you all right?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:56.510
Who are you?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.720
I-Io...?

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:18.990
F-For a moment there,
I couldn't tell who you were.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.740
Io...

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.240
Celeste.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:42.300
Looks like our best bet is to go with your plan.
Now to actually get to it.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.550
Speed is the key here.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:45.760
Right.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.270
So that only leaves Ferry.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.850
She's looking for some kinda info.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.650
I'm sure I left it around here somewhere...

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.370
That hurt...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.330
Found it!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.630
You guys! Take a look at this!

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:22.550
After that, we'll have to play it by ear.
Just charge into it.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.090
Understood.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.220
Sturm and I will back you up
with all our might, okay?

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:30.980
Ferry?

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.850
Did you find what you were looking for?

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.400
Y-Yeah...

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:39.980
What's wrong?
You had the saddest look on your face just now.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:44.610
Yeah... I thought that you guys
couldn't see me again.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.870
But that's not what happened.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:53.830
It's a good feeling,
having people call you by name.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.590
Even if it's not your real name.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.170
Ferry...

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.170
Seriously, you're something else!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:06.300
I mean, you've been on your own for a century,
not even knowing who you are.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.930
Don't you have the slightest
memory of something?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.220
Say like...

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.020
About your family?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:17.810
My family?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:22.570
I do feel the pain of
having lost something precious.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:28.320
It's easy to imagine that
the precious thing is my family.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:33.500
But I don't remember anything at all.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:39.000
All I have is this pain, and the feeling
that I was left behind, all alone.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:40.960
You don't say...

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.170
<i>Yay!</i>

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.180
<i>Dad, do it again! Do it again!</i>

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.930
<i>Okay!</i>

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.110
Wallow in sentiment later.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:04.740
I know.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:10.280
Ferry, I'd like you to help us
rescue Lyria and the others.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.290
Even though it might mean
putting you in danger again...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.960
Don't give it a second thought.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:19.210
I'm the one who asked you
to find Celeste in the first place.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.840
So that I could find out who I am...

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.710
So let me ask you.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.970
Please help me out, Gran.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.310
This just might be useful to us.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.270
What's this?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.740
It's on the other side of this door...

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.370
I can feel it.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.490
So this is the goal line, huh?

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.420
I'm gonna open it!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.600
This place is...

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.770
I'm impressed that you made it here.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.650
Or rather, that you were guided here.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.400
Celeste!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.110
- No, that's not Celeste!
- It's not.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.200
Huh? This isn't Celeste?

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:46.300
This is the primal beast Celeste's core,
where souls are enthroned.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:50.720
Where everything begins,
and where everything ends.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.760
I-Is this...

00:15:56.970 --> 00:16:01.100
Celeste steals the memories
of those she swallows,

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.810
preserving scenes of their past lives
within her being.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.150
That's right...

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.740
Dad took me there when I was a kid.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.240
The Valtz desert, and the lava lake...

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.580
The Lumacie Forest....

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:24.880
Then all this time, we've been walking
through scenes of Io's memories?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.090
Memories and ego...

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.470
In return for their souls,

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:35.050
humans gain time eternal here
where their spirits may come to rest.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:40.980
Io!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:49.320
And I gain existence eternal
by devouring those souls.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.320
Wh-Why, you...

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.950
Offer up your soul to me.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.320
No way would I give it to you!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.210
Orchis!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.760
Lyria...

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:31.530
Io!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.750
Ah, would you look at that!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.340
There's no question that the ritual
was carried out after all.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.090
This is where Celeste was summoned,
a hundred years ago.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:57.680
Ferry.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.100
Let's get started.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:02.930
Right.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:07.850
Actually, I've tried to summon Celeste here before.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.270
It was, well...

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:18.240
However, Celeste has appeared again
to come after me since I've become visible.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:31.750
But now I have you, Gran.
And you share a connection with Lyria.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.800
If I serve as the bait, and Gran is our guide,

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.590
even if we're not mages....

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.010
We should still attract Celeste.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.140
No, she will come. She has to.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.730
Drang? Sturm?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.980
Right! You can leave the rest to us!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.650
We promise to protect Ferry.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.830
I ask, and appeal to thee.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:06.790
Wanderer of the skies, show thyself before me.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.710
Endow me with thy power.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.580
<i>I'm going to rescue them from Celeste.</i>

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:15.300
Resurrect the dead,
and turn the living into the dead.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:16.710
<i>And then I'm going to reverse this evil curse
that's afflicted me for a century,</i>

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.970
<i>and go back to being myself!</i>

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.140
Lyria...

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:32.060
Io! Please hang in there!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.230
Open your eyes!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:38.570
She has offered her soul to me
and gained eternal time.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:41.240
This is the power of the primal beast, Celeste.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.120
You're wrong!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:46.240
You're twisting Celeste's powers
for your own gain!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.160
What?

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.620
Celeste doesn't want this.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:54.710
That's why Celeste led us here.
She wanted our help.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.170
You're in the way.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.340
Shut up!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.760
Now, you're not what I expected...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:10.430
I was aware that you were a foreign entity,
but I never dreamed that you'd have this.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:14.270
You two, how did you come to have
the power of the Astrals?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.530
Please save us, Bahamut!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.490
It's no use.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:23.610
Your voices will never be heard
outside of me.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.740
N-No way...

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:30.620
I will take possession of all of your powers.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.130
L-Lyria...

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.340
Orchis...

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.690
Lyria...

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:56.980
Orchis...

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:02.360
You inhuman beings, become my nourishment!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.080
Gran!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:10.740
What's wrong?

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.830
L-Lyria...

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:23.880
Come out, Celeste!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
EPISODE 7
MEMORIES OF FAMILY

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.140
Next episode, "Memories of Family."
